section
  - if header
    h2.px-4.pb-1.5.text-xs.font-medium.uppercase.tracking-wide.text-muted = header
  / White on the gray page of a phone, gray on the white box of the desktop.
    Clip, not hidden: a hidden overflow can scroll, and the focus of a radio
    in a cell would scroll the card and show the cut-off separator. A clip
    does not hold the margin of the last row, flow-root does.
  ul.flow-root.overflow-clip.rounded-xl.bg-surface.lg:bg-fill
    - cells.each do |cell|
      = cell
  - if footer
    .px-4.pt-1.5.text-xs.text-muted = footer
